### 获得我的进件申请列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/apply/my-list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 获得商户分页（运营用）
GET {{baseUrl}}/merchant/merchant/page?pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 停用/启用商户（status：2 生效 / 4 停用；运营用）
PUT {{baseUrl}}/merchant/merchant/update-status?id=1&status=4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

### 汇付 KYC 进件审核结果回调（汇付服务器调用，模拟报文见 docs/huifu，需用平台私钥重签）
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/huifu/kyc-callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resp_code": "00000000",
  "resp_desc": "成功",
  "req_seq_id": "M202609281200000001ABCD",
  "apply_status": "Y",
  "apply_reason": "审核通过",
  "huifu_id": "6666000000000001",
  "sign": "replace-with-correct-sign"
}

### 汇付业务开通结果回调（汇付服务器调用，模拟报文需重签）
POST {{baseUrl}}/merchant/huifu/busi-callback
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resp_code": "00000000",
  "resp_desc": "成功",
  "ord_id": "2026092812000001",
  "huifu_id": "6666000000000001",
  "sign": "replace-with-correct-sign"
}
